'''Gifts (2024)''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 3rd tier of the [[Christmas Event 2024]] battle pass.

== Appearance ==
This knife features a purple-pink ombre blade decorated with yellow stars and red, green, and blue gift boxes. The blade is attached to a purple guard and a dark gray handle.

